WEBVTT

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:03.991
1

00:00:05.032 --> 00:00:07.375
I <b>always</b> watch TV in the evening.

00:00:09.424 --> 00:00:11.599
Do you <b>usually</<b> sleep for eight hours?

00:00:13.658 --> 00:00:15.749
She <b>sometimes</b> plays sports.

00:00:17.866 --> 00:00:19.599
He <b>often</b> has lunch at work.

00:00:21.683 --> 00:00:23.832
She doesn’t <b>often</b> go to bed late.

00:00:26.508 --> 00:00:27.099
2

00:00:28.182 --> 00:00:30.108
They’re <b>hardly ever</b> late.

00:00:32.208 --> 00:00:34.399
He isn’t <b>often</b> stressed.

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:39.179
Are you <b>usually</b> in this classroom?

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:42.454
3

00:00:43.546 --> 00:00:46.593
I go to Italian classes <b>twice a week</b>.

00:00:48.662 --> 00:00:50.893
She doesn’t work <b>every day</b>.